# Logs
# Anchored to this package root on purpose. An unanchored `logs` also matches
# `src/**/logs/`, which silently swallowed `src/components/admin/logs/` — the
# admin log viewer's components. It built on the machine that wrote them and
# failed on every clean clone (Vercel, CI).
/logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
coverage
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
